{"schema_version": "answer-clean-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q012", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 12, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "cleaning_status": "unbounded_answer_field", "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "external_reference_candidate": null, "external_reference_status": null, "external_reference_candidates": [], "local_reference_candidate": null, "local_reference_status": null, "source_answer_text_sha256": "c3e17aa6fc710c840567fb584d981d18d94974dcb217b24ded384eaf37c1f1c5", "raw_answer_text_length": 237, "question_excerpt": null, "question_excerpt_sha256": null, "analysis_excerpt": null, "analysis_excerpt_sha256": null, "answer_marker": null, "solution_excerpt": null, "solution_excerpt_sha256": null, "answer_key_marker": null, "answer_key_excerpt": null, "answer_key_excerpt_sha256": null, "answer_candidate_text": "（1）（4分）写了两个层次。\n\n前四句为第一层次，主要写向往归隐的理由。由春花秋月引起先阴如箭之叹，由鸟啼雁归生出人情淡薄之慨。\n\n后几句为第二层次，主要写向往中的隐居生活。其中又分为两层，“留下”句至“秧肥”句为第一层，写归隐后的物质生活：“床边”之后的几句为第二层，写归隐后的精神生活。 人\n\n(2)（4分）①对偶，如“秋月”句对“春花”句等；②比喻，如将“人情”比作“云”，“风景”比为“箭”等；③夸张，将“风景”比为“箭”的同时又兼用了夸张的方法。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "5f9f3583dccd8f9dd2abf827b31c67d3b5934b87aed936a0755d390fe0aa4ffb", "answer_candidate_prefix_removed": "12.（8分）\n\n", "answer_candidate_prefix_removed_sha256": "99c631fc3d259057d6237a1a95e29757bd57d6ba0a67cd2f06c9b51b7c745bfb", "content_shape": "answer_scoring_excerpt_no_marker", "marker_inventory": [], "nested_analysis_marker_count": 0, "nested_answer_marker_count": 0, "marker_separation_status": "singl